.TH SYMMETRY 1
.SH NAME
symmetry \- mirror drawing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/symmetry
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Symmetry
is a mirror drawing.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 2 sets a mirror line; button 1 draws strokes mirrored across it.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B RMB
Set mirror line
.TP
.B LMB drag
Draw (mirrored)
.TP
.B c
Clear
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/symmetry.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
